        <detaileddescription>
<para>Text after the last member definition.</para><para>This is the input text that appears after the last property definition and before the end of the entire class definition. It ends just before the closing curly brace for the class definition. If the class has no properties, then this is the entire body of the class definition (everthing between the opening and closing curly braces, excluding the braces).</para><para>The text is modified by removing trailing white space from each line, replacing consecutive blank lines with a single blank line, and removing leading and trailing blank lines. </para>        </detaileddescription>
